Z||000002||filthyscarecrow||07-15-2001||11:39 PM||||racing an indycar would be incredible. the problem? you're too old. so am i. i'm 22. if you haven't been racing karts for at least the last 10 years, you're too old. best bet? save up so your kids can race karts. live vicariously through them. or you could front a helluva lotta money and race f-won. it's a series for owners of older f1 cars. i guess you can just arrive adn drive. from what i hear they have a 97 arrows, a 98 benetton, a 93 lotus (that'd be my choice... active suspension... now i'm drooling) and a few others. hey, it ain't CART, but it would still be incredible...||||reg||1
